# The pbip project round-trips through Power BI Desktop on a Windows VM, which
# rewrites every file it touches with CRLF. Without this, one Save As returned
# a 3,800-line diff for three real edits and buried them.
#
# Store LF in the repo and check out LF: Desktop reads either, and a diff that
# shows only what changed is the whole reason the report lives here as text.
pbip/** text=auto eol=lf
